# What this machine needs beyond the site: never on the hosts, which sync
# requirements.txt alone (deploy.sh).  The pinned set is requirements-dev.txt,
# compiled with `make lock`; -c holds every package the two share to the
# site's own pin, so .venv runs the site exactly as the hosts do.
-r requirements.in
-c requirements.txt

# tools/offline_e2e.py (`make e2e`): Work offline, driven in Chrome.  It drives
# the system's Chrome (/usr/bin/google-chrome), so never `playwright install`,
# which would download browsers into ~/.cache.
playwright
